WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.488
The guard took the children to the palace.

2
00:00:10.489 --> 00:00:16.961
Vinnie and Mandy were scared, but they had never seen a place so grand.

3
00:00:16.962 --> 00:00:21.127
There were so many courtyards and fountains.

4
00:00:21.128 --> 00:00:26.806
Everything glittered with gold.

5
00:00:26.807 --> 00:00:30.334
"This place is big!" said Vinnie.

6
00:00:30.335 --> 00:00:34.215
"Bigger than Versailles," Mandy added.

7
00:00:34.216 --> 00:00:38.142
Two more guards came out of a palace gate.

8
00:00:38.143 --> 00:00:42.680
They walked over to the guard who was holding the children.

9
00:00:42.681 --> 00:00:46.286
All the guards began whispering at once.

10
00:00:46.287 --> 00:00:48.813
Their faces were angry.

11
00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:52.675
"It is time," said one guard.

12
00:00:52.676 --> 00:00:57.732
"We hoped the sultan would raise our pay," said another guard.

13
00:00:57.733 --> 00:01:01.069
"But he only cares about his own riches."

14
00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:04.668
"We have no choice," said the first guard.

15
00:01:04.669 --> 00:01:06.404
"We must act!"

16
00:01:06.405 --> 00:01:11.620
The guards huddled together, and the children were forgotten.

17
00:01:11.621 --> 00:01:14.170
"Come on!" cried Vinnie.

18
00:01:14.171 --> 00:01:16.542
He pulled his sister's arm.

19
00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:18.885
"Let's get out of here!"

20
00:01:18.886 --> 00:01:22.466
The children ran into a nearby building.

21
00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:27.000
It was a huge kitchen made up of ten large rooms.

22
00:01:27.001 --> 00:01:30.260
Each room had a tall chimney.

23
00:01:30.261 --> 00:01:34.705
"This is a kitchen?" Vinnie said, amazed.

24
00:01:34.706 --> 00:01:37.740
Many people were rushing around.

25
00:01:37.741 --> 00:01:42.414
Everyone was busy cooking, washing, or chopping.

26
00:01:42.415 --> 00:01:48.013
"How many people do you cook for?" Mandy asked a young cook.

27
00:01:48.014 --> 00:01:50.035
He wiped his face.

28
00:01:50.036 --> 00:01:54.146
"Over four thousand people," he replied.

29
00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:58.452
"Sometimes, we cook six thousand meals a day."

30
00:01:58.453 --> 00:02:01.350
Mandy could not believe it.

31
00:02:01.351 --> 00:02:05.681
"Look at all those dishes!" she cried.

32
00:02:05.682 --> 00:02:10.561
Then she saw more Janissary guards entering the kitchen.

33
00:02:10.562 --> 00:02:13.053
They looked very angry.

34
00:02:13.054 --> 00:02:14.830
She poked Vinnie.

35
00:02:14.831 --> 00:02:17.551
"Vinnie! They found us!"

36
00:02:17.552 --> 00:02:20.101
Mandy pointed at the door.

37
00:02:20.102 --> 00:02:21.990
"What should we do?"

38
00:02:21.991 --> 00:02:25.608
she whispered, looking for a place to hide.

39
00:02:25.609 --> 00:02:28.297
But the guards ignored the children.

40
00:02:28.298 --> 00:02:31.938
Instead, they picked up big pots.

41
00:02:31.939 --> 00:02:34.819
The kitchen workers looked frightened.

42
00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:39.552
"What's happening?" Vinnie asked one of the cooks.

43
00:02:39.553 --> 00:02:43.220
Each guard was carrying a large pot.

44
00:02:43.221 --> 00:02:45.879
The leader of the guards called out,

45
00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:51.013
"We will make the sultan listen!"

46
00:02:51.014 --> 00:02:55.551
All the guards cheered loudly and marched from the kitchen.

47
00:02:55.552 --> 00:02:59.808
"Where are they going?" Mandy asked the cook.

48
00:02:59.809 --> 00:03:03.013
"They want more money," said the cook.

49
00:03:03.014 --> 00:03:06.942
"The guards have been angry with the sultan for a long time.

50
00:03:06.943 --> 00:03:10.558
They want the sultan to fill the pots with gold."

51
00:03:10.559 --> 00:03:14.405
People started shouting throughout the palace.

52
00:03:14.406 --> 00:03:18.401
"Mandy, let's go!" cried Vinnie.

53
00:03:18.402 --> 00:03:21.477
The children ran out of the kitchen.

54
00:03:21.478 --> 00:03:27.422
They followed the Janissary up some marble steps and through a large door.

55
00:03:27.423 --> 00:03:32.689
Soon, Vinnie and Mandy were in a big colorful room.

56
00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:39.406
A man wearing a turban with a white feather sat on a red throne just inside.

57
00:03:39.407 --> 00:03:43.549
"That must be the sultan," cried Mandy.

58
00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:45.142
"We can't stay.

59
00:03:45.143 --> 00:03:49.885
Let's get out of here and find a way back home," said Vinnie.

60
00:03:49.886 --> 00:03:54.920
The children ran out of the throne room and into a courtyard.

61
00:03:54.921 --> 00:03:59.273
"I hope you know where you're going," Mandy said.

62
00:03:59.274 --> 00:04:03.551
"Don't worry, Mandy" said Vinnie as they ran.

63
00:04:03.552 --> 00:04:07.202
Soon they were outside of the palace.

64
00:04:07.203 --> 00:04:11.080
"Look! Over there!" Vinnie pointed.

65
00:04:11.081 --> 00:04:13.794
Another mosque was nearby.

66
00:04:13.795 --> 00:04:17.003
The dome shone brightly in the sun.

67
00:04:17.004 --> 00:04:19.098
Vinnie took out the photo.

68
00:04:19.099 --> 00:04:21.404
It was glowing blue.

69
00:04:21.405 --> 00:04:27.249
"Four towers . . . " he said, counting the towers around the mosque.

70
00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:32.434
Then, the photo started to glow red.

71
00:04:32.435 --> 00:04:34.777
"Mandy, this is it!"

72
00:04:34.778 --> 00:04:37.541
Vinnie grabbed his sister's hand.

73
00:04:37.542 --> 00:04:46.658
"We're really going home!"
